\fs36 This script checks your entire iTunes Library for missing (and presumed "dead") tracks -- those that iTunes is unable to associate with a local file and which are listed in iTunes with a "!".\
\
The script then creates a text file listing each Playlist and any tracks MIA, which you can view using TextEdit.\
\
To clear these tracks from iTunes, try using the AppleScript "Super Remove Dead Tracks", available at:\
